<%# The server's disk is full. %>
<p>
  Old images and build layers pile up with every deploy and eventually fill
  the disk. This is the most common failure on a small server that's been
  running a long time.
</p>

<p>Clear out the old layers. This removes unused images, not your running site:</p>
<pre>ssh <%= user %>@<%= host %> 'docker system prune -af'</pre>

<p>Then deploy again.</p>

<p>
  More detail:
  <a href="/documentation/roe/troubleshoot-deployment#troubleshooting-kamal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Troubleshooting → Deployment</a>
</p>
